{"step_index":251,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-21T00:09:24Z","thinking":"The script will receive a list of companies and iteratively query a business search engine. Each company name will be used as the initial search term, and the search engine snippets will be parsed for relevance. If the name query returns no relevant results, a secondary search using the company's phone number will be executed. The focus is to identify Busan-based companies by examining the search snippets, IDs, and direct name matches.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"import json\\nimport urllib.request\\nimport urllib.parse\\nimport re\\nimport time\\nimport os\\nfrom concurrent.futures import ThreadPoolExecutor, as_completed\\nimport threading\\n\\nHEADERS = {\\n    \\\"User-Agent\\\": \\\"Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/120.0.0.0 Safari/537.36\\\"\\n}\\n\\nprogress_lock = threading.Lock()\\n\\ndef clean_company_name(name):\\n    if not name: return \\\"\\\"\\n    clean = re.sub(r'\\\\(주\\\\)|주식회사|\\\\(유\\\\)|\\\\(사\\\\)|\\\\(재\\\\)|\\\\(합\\\\)|\\\\(주식회사\\\\)', '', name).strip()\\n    return clean\\n\\ndef parse_search_page(query):\\n    if not query or len(query.strip()) < 2:\\n        return []\\n    url = f\\\"https://bizno.net/?query={urllib.parse.quote(query.strip())}\\\"\\n    req = urllib.request.Request(url, headers=HEADERS)\\n    try:\\n        with urllib.request.urlopen(req, timeout=10) as resp:\\n            html = resp.read().decode('utf-8', errors='ignore')\\n    except:\\n        return []\\n        \\n    posts = re.findall(r'<div class=\\\"single-post[\\\\s\\\\S]*?(?=<div class=\\\"single-post|<section|<footer>|$)', html)\\n    results = []\\n    seen = set()\\n    for p in posts:\\n        art_match = re.search(r'href=[\\\"\\\\']/article/(\\\\d{10})[\\\"\\\\']', p)\\n        if not art_match:\\n            continue\\n        art_id = art_match.group(1)\\n        if art_id in seen:\\n            continue\\n        seen.add(art_id)\\n        \\n        # text inside post\\n        clean_text = re.sub(r'\\\\s+', ' ', re.sub(r'<[^>]+>', ' ', p)).strip()\\n        results.append({\\n            \\\"biz_no_10\\\": art_id,\\n            \\\"snippet\\\": clean_text\\n        })\\n    return results\\n\\ndef get_bizno_detail(biz_no_10):\\n    url = f\\\"https://bizno.net/article/{biz_no_10}\\\"\\n    req = urllib.request.Request(url, headers=HEADERS)\\n    try:\\n        with urllib.request.urlopen(req, timeout=10) as resp:\\n            html = resp.read().decode('utf-8', errors='ignore')\\n            \\n            desc_match = re.search(r'<meta\\\\s+name=[\\\"\\\\']description[\\\"\\\\']\\\\s+content=[\\\"\\\\'](.*?)[\\\"\\\\']'\n<truncated 9488 bytes>","Description":"\"Fast multithreaded Bizno scanner for all 318 target companies\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\lg\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\cc5f8116-f40f-4d66-a990-d85efe7bc64f\\\\scratch\\\\fast_bizno_scanner.py\"","toolAction":"\"Writing scanner script\"","toolSummary":"\"Write fast_bizno_scanner.py\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
