{"step_index":273,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-21T00:10:13Z","thinking":"Address verification is critical; a Busan location or a Busan-specific branch designation with a Busan address is the only acceptable match. Any candidate outside of Busan, regardless of branch affiliation, is an invalid match. Company name matching must also be precise, adhering to the target company's designation.\n\n\nInitial hypothesis: Systematically iterate through each of the 318 companies, prioritizing missing business registration numbers. Data will be gathered from Bizno, MoneyPin, NiceBizInfo, CookieDeal, Naver Map, and KakaoMap. Employment data will be fixed to Bizno if available. Address, CEO, and phone number validation criteria will determine a match.\n\nIt is critical to determine the source of the 318 companies list. Inspecting the example data, the companies seem to be clustered in buildings within the Busan area, specifically in Haeundae-gu and Busan Jin-gu. This indicates a geographical focus that needs to be taken into account.\n\n\nA script will be created to perform a rigorous search for each company using the specified data sources, emphasizing strict address and name matching within the Busan region. The script's primary goal is to extract business registration numbers, CEO names, establishment dates, employee count (only from Bizno), addresses, phone numbers, and fax numbers. Verification of the company's registration details against Busan addresses will be prioritized for accuracy.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"import json\\nimport urllib.request\\nimport urllib.parse\\nimport re\\nimport time\\n\\nHEADERS = {\\n    \\\"User-Agent\\\": \\\"Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/120.0.0.0 Safari/537.36\\\"\\n}\\n\\ndef clean_company_name(name):\\n    if not name: return \\\"\\\"\\n    clean = re.sub(r'\\\\(주\\\\)|주식회사|\\\\(유\\\\)|\\\\(사\\\\)|\\\\(재\\\\)|\\\\(합\\\\)|\\\\(주식회사\\\\)', '', name).strip()\\n    return clean\\n\\ndef parse_search_page(query):\\n    if not query or len(query.strip()) < 2:\\n        return []\\n    url = f\\\"https://bizno.net/?query={urllib.parse.quote(query.strip())}\\\"\\n    req = urllib.request.Request(url, headers=HEADERS)\\n    try:\\n        with urllib.request.urlopen(req, timeout=8) as resp:\\n            html = resp.read().decode('utf-8', errors='ignore')\\n    except:\\n        return []\\n        \\n    posts = re.findall(r'<div class=\\\"single-post[\\\\s\\\\S]*?(?=<div class=\\\"single-post|<section|<footer>|$)', html)\\n    results = []\\n    seen = set()\\n    for p in posts:\\n        art_match = re.search(r'href=[\\\"\\\\']/article/(\\\\d{10})[\\\"\\\\']', p)\\n        if not art_match:\\n            continue\\n        art_id = art_match.group(1)\\n        if art_id in seen:\\n            continue\\n        seen.add(art_id)\\n        clean_text = re.sub(r'\\\\s+', ' ', re.sub(r'<[^>]+>', ' ', p)).strip()\\n        results.append({\\n            \\\"biz_no_10\\\": art_id,\\n            \\\"snippet\\\": clean_text\\n        })\\n    return results\\n\\ndef get_bizno_detail(biz_no_10):\\n    url = f\\\"https://bizno.net/article/{biz_no_10}\\\"\\n    req = urllib.request.Request(url, headers=HEADERS)\\n    try:\\n        with urllib.request.urlopen(req, timeout=8) as resp:\\n            html = resp.read().decode('utf-8', errors='ignore')\\n            \\n            desc_match = re.search(r'<meta\\\\s+name=[\\\"\\\\']description[\\\"\\\\']\\\\s+content=[\\\"\\\\'](.*?)[\\\"\\\\']', html)\\n            desc = desc_match.group(1) if desc_match else \\\"\\\"\\n            \\n            title_match = re.search(r'<title>(.*?)</title>', html)\\n            tit\n<truncated 4589 bytes>","Description":"\"Test rigorous search for Centum and incubator companies\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\lg\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\cc5f8116-f40f-4d66-a990-d85efe7bc64f\\\\scratch\\\\test_rigorous.py\"","toolAction":"\"Testing rigorous search\"","toolSummary":"\"Test Centum companies lookup\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
